/s 1 swidth def
0.0 0.5 0.625 StartRGB
0.0 0.0 1.0 EndRGB
stack
0 Step s {
StepRGB
newpath
0.0 swidth exch moveto % position left hand side
1.0 swidth 0 rlineto % draw a line
stroke
} for
